# The user's global gitignore (~/.gitignore_global) excludes *.md so that stray
# credential notes never get committed. That rule also silently swallowed every
# post in content/posts, which is why the blog shipped empty. A repo-level
# negation takes precedence over the global file, so markdown here is tracked.
!*.md
!content/posts/*.md
